不北走胡即南走越耳。夫忌壯士以資敵國，此伍子胥所以鞭荊平王之墓也。君何不從容爲上言邪？」汝陰侯滕公心知朱家大俠，意季布匿其所，乃許曰：「諾。」待閒，果言如朱家指。上乃赦季布。當是時，諸公皆多季布能摧剛爲柔，朱家亦以此名聞當世。季布召見，謝，上拜爲郎中。","source_term":"誡其子"}],"interpretation_note":"明示子字與本傳承接直接父子；欒布父名在前段，子賁在相鄰後段，保存兩段證據。分支不表示長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-100-jibu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-100","chapter_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu","raw_mention_count":9,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0130","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0136","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0169","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0189","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0240","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0263","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0385","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0411","c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0437"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0130","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0130"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0136","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0136"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0169","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0169"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0189","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0189"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0240","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0240"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0263","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0263"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0385","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0385"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0411","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0411"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0437","mention_ids":["c-shiji-100-jibu:m001-0437"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":9,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":9,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"anno